          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અપવાદ — apvād — \"an exception\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો તમે બીમાર હશો તો અમે અપવાદ કરીશું. jo tame bīmār haśo to ame apvād karīśũ. If you are ill, we will make an exception."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અપવાદ (apvād) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit apavāda, \"speaking against; a refutation\" (Monier-Williams); in grammar and in rules it is the case that does not follow."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
